    },
    {
      "id": "song-280",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "风前欲劝春光住",
      "author": "辛弃疾",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "风前欲劝春光住。春在城南芳草路。未随流落水边花，且作飘零泥上絮。\n镜中已觉星星误。人不负春春自负。梦回人远许多愁，只在梨花风雨处。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e3ce0d16ad6e3581af152d2d443c95a6527ec73f31c128798b84bed9eaad0e98",
      "estimatedOutput": 730,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-280--e3ce0d16ad6e3581af152d2d443c95a6527ec73f31c128798b84bed9eaad0e98.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-281",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "忆秦娥",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张元干",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "桃花萼。雨肥红绽东风恶。东风恶。长亭无寐，短书难托。\n征衫辜负深闺约。禁烟时候春罗薄。春罗薄。多应消瘦，可堪梳掠。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b7647b87283b2f9fc817d1af53edd2744f160572e1d4aaa2e15052a3e04b56c6",
      "estimatedOutput": 714,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-281--b7647b87283b2f9fc817d1af53edd2744f160572e1d4aaa2e15052a3e04b56c6.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-282",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "醉别西楼醒不记",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "醉别西楼醒不记。春梦秋云，聚散真容易。斜月半窗还少睡。画屏闲展吴山翠。\n衣上酒痕诗里字。点点行行，总是凄凉意。红烛自怜无好计。夜寒空替人垂泪。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "145e76afd7aa1f4806a121094bb25de529a490ae3a64ff48aafdd1511b7f9de1",
